00:00:41.790 --> 00:00:43.139
Hagrid: NONSENSE.

00:00:43.182 --> 00:00:44.880
WHY WOULD SNAPE
PUT A CURSE

00:00:44.923 --> 00:00:45.924
ON HARRY'S BROOM?

00:00:45.968 --> 00:00:46.969
WHO KNOWS?

00:00:47.012 --> 00:00:48.057
WHY WAS HE TRYING
TO GET PAST

00:00:48.100 --> 00:00:49.493
THAT 3-HEADED DOG
ON HALLOWEEN?

00:00:49.537 --> 00:00:51.756
WHO TOLD YOU
ABOUT FLUFFY?

00:00:51.800 --> 00:00:52.975
FLUFFY?

00:00:53.018 --> 00:00:54.585
THAT THING
HAS A NAME?

00:00:54.629 --> 00:00:55.760
WELL, OF COURSE
HE'S GOT A NAME.

00:00:55.804 --> 00:00:56.848
HE'S MINE.

00:00:56.892 --> 00:00:57.980
I BOUGHT HIM
OFF AN IRISH FELLER

00:00:58.023 --> 00:00:59.851
I MET DOWN AT THE PUB
LAST YEAR.

00:00:59.895 --> 00:01:01.331
THEN I LENT HIM TO
DUMBLEDORE TO GUARD THE...

00:01:01.374 --> 00:01:02.637
YES?

00:01:02.680 --> 00:01:04.508
SHOULDN'T HAVE SAID THAT.
NO MORE QUESTIONS.

00:01:04.552 --> 00:01:05.857
DON'T ASK
ANY MORE QUESTIONS.

00:01:05.901 --> 00:01:07.598
THAT'S TOP SECRET, THAT IS.

00:01:07.642 --> 00:01:08.599
BUT, HAGRID,

00:01:08.643 --> 00:01:09.818
WHATEVER
FLUFFY'S GUARDING,

00:01:09.861 --> 00:01:11.689
SNAPE'S TRYING
TO STEAL IT.

00:01:11.733 --> 00:01:13.299
CODSWALLOP.

00:01:13.343 --> 00:01:15.258
PROFESSOR SNAPE
IS A HOGWARTS TEACHER.

00:01:15.301 --> 00:01:17.173
HOGWARTS TEACHER
OR NOT,

00:01:17.216 --> 00:01:19.392
I KNOW A SPELL
WHEN I SEE ONE.

00:01:19.436 --> 00:01:20.872
I'VE READ
ALL ABOUT THEM.

00:01:20.916 --> 00:01:22.570
YOU'VE GOT TO KEEP
EYE CONTACT,

00:01:22.613 --> 00:01:24.833
AND SNAPE
WASN'T BLINKING.

00:01:24.876 --> 00:01:25.964
EXACTLY.

00:01:26.008 --> 00:01:27.487
[SIGHS]

00:01:27.531 --> 00:01:30.316
NOW YOU LISTEN TO ME,
ALL THREE OF YOU.

00:01:30.360 --> 00:01:31.579
YOU'RE MEDDLING
IN THINGS

00:01:31.622 --> 00:01:33.102
THAT OUGHT NOT
TO BE MEDDLED IN.

00:01:33.145 --> 00:01:35.408
IT'S DANGEROUS.

00:01:35.452 --> 00:01:36.627
WHAT THAT DOG
IS GUARDING

00:01:36.671 --> 00:01:38.629
IS STRICTLY BETWEEN
PROFESSOR DUMBLEDORE

00:01:38.673 --> 00:01:39.848
AND NICHOLAS FLAMEL.

00:01:39.891 --> 00:01:42.241
NICHOLAS FLAMEL?

00:01:42.285 --> 00:01:44.548
I SHOULDN'T
HAVE SAID THAT.

00:01:44.592 --> 00:01:46.724
I SHOULD NOT
HAVE SAID THAT.

00:01:46.768 --> 00:01:47.725
I SHOULDN'T
HAVE SAID THAT.

00:01:47.769 --> 00:01:49.640
NICHOLAS FLAMEL.

00:01:49.684 --> 00:01:52.208
Harry:
WHO'S NICHOLAS FLAMEL?

00:01:52.251 --> 00:01:55.167
I DON'T KNOW.

